comments.body:
Hi @krishna1928 Thanks for opening this issue. From what I can see in your example it would be:

```javascript
var search = instantsearch({
  appId: '4NZQF4XNOY',
  apiKey: '72373ded8908cd22ebf017bb35e0774d', // search only API key, no ADMIN key
  indexName: 'mytfc',
  urlSync: true,
  searchParameters: {
    query:querysearchvalue,
    disjunctiveFacets: ['country'],
    disjunctiveFacetsRefinements: {country: ['canada|usa', 'usa'] }
  }
});
```
